OL,3,GNEWSACoffee shop reaps rewards of
OL,4,AAlbion's flying form
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bakery has been reaping the rewards
OL,7,Fof Brighton & Hove Albion's rich vein
OL,8,Fof form with players purchasing rounds
OL,9,Fof coffee to celebrate games in which
OL,10,Fthey have not conceded any goals.
OL,12,FThe Flour Pot Bakery in Brighton said
OL,13,Fit was invited to the training ground
OL,14,Fto serve first team players and
OL,15,Fgoalkeeper Bart Verbruggen was normally
OL,16,Fthe one to foot the bill.
OL,18,FMariana Katsouris, from the bakery,
OL,19,Ftold BBC Radio Sussex: "He always likes
OL,20,Fto treat the team and everyone else."
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
